  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math> and <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&amp;&nbsp;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&amp;&nbsp;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&amp;&nbsp;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;(Which is impossible)<br />Hence, no value of <math><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;exists",
